<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="P.S. Toushindai No Love Song"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIREI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Answer"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPU901802292"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1538283044"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">比起说上一百万次我爱你</text><text for="L2">更有长长久久想要好好珍视之物</text><text for="L3">你那不加修饰、率直赤诚的心意</text><text for="L4">能够悉数收下的我 真的无比幸福啊</text><text for="L5">朋友的朋友 偶然赴约的一场午餐</text><text for="L6">只顾喝着咖啡代替搭话 沉默寡言的你</text><text for="L7">听不懂玩笑 却又偏偏天然少根筋</text><text for="L8">明明是个奇怪的人 却让人越来越想去探寻</text><text for="L9">无论工作还是朋友你都看得很重</text><text for="L10">总是一副睡眠不足的模样</text><text for="L11">一笑起来就皱成一团的脸庞 真的可爱极了</text><text for="L12">一沾了酒便开始倾诉畅谈呢</text><text for="L13">畅想属于我们两人的未来</text><text for="L14">每见一面便多喜欢你一分 往后定然也是如此</text><text for="L15">比起千百句我爱你</text><text for="L16">只要你能用力拥抱我一次就好</text><text for="L17">仅凭那个拥抱 你的心思</text><text for="L18">我便能完完全全懂得明了</text><text for="L19">当全心全意深爱上一个人时</text><text for="L20">那些如台词般的甜言蜜语根本不需要</text><text for="L21">你那毫无掩饰、坦坦荡荡的情感</text><text for="L22">能够全然接纳的我 就已经足够幸福啦</text><text for="L23">彼此都很忙碌 明明疲倦不堪却还在熬夜</text><text for="L24">听筒那头渐渐没了回音 唯有浅浅睡息传来</text><text for="L25">无论怎样体贴关切 你总是一句没关系呢</text><text for="L26">那是你的温柔？ 还是觉得依赖我也毫无意义？</text><text for="L27">什么都不说只是独自咬牙硬撑</text><text for="L28">虽然那确实很像你的作风</text><text for="L29">可我讨厌连你难过的缘由都一无所知啊</text><text for="L30">尽管当初是被你的坚韧所吸引</text><text for="L31">但我并不喜欢你的逞强</text><text for="L32">希望能被你更多依赖 因为我会为你分担一切</text><text for="L33">比起数不尽的我爱你</text><text for="L34">更有长相厮守想要用心珍重之物</text><text for="L35">我究竟能为你做些什么呢</text><text for="L36">独自在昏暗的房中反复思索</text><text for="L37">当发自肺腑爱慕一个人的时候</text><text for="L38">那些权衡与试探一定都毫无必要</text><text for="L39">你那不事粉饰、澄澈真挚的心意</text><text for="L40">能够拥入怀中的我 真的无比幸福啊</text><text for="L41">哭喊着让我一个人静静 嚷着别再管我了</text><text for="L42">痛苦难过时明明只会靠逞强来保护自己</text><text for="L43">你却突然奔赴而来 让我泪水决堤而出</text><text for="L44">果然我的世界唯独不能没有你</text><text for="L45">“比起说上一百万次我爱你</text><text for="L46">紧紧抱住你一次不是来得更快吗”</text><text for="L47">平日不解风情的你 送给我的情歌</text><text for="L48">是比世间万物都要珍重的无价之宝</text><text for="L49">当义无反顾深爱上一个人时</text><text for="L50">那些矫揉造作的甜言蜜语全然多余</text><text for="L51">你那毫无矫饰、一心一意的深情</text><text for="L52">能够全心拥有的我 便是全世界最幸福的人啊</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:33.765"><div begin="0:01.016" end="4:33.765"><p begin="0:01.016" end="0:04.406" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:01.016" end="0:01.636">百</span><span begin="0:01.636" end="0:02.046">万</span><span begin="0:02.046" end="0:02.376">回</span><span begin="0:02.376" end="0:02.576">の</span><span begin="0:02.576" end="0:02.766">愛</span><span begin="0:02.766" end="0:02.916">し</span><span begin="0:02.916" end="0:03.056">て</span><span begin="0:03.056" end="0:03.186">る</span><span begin="0:03.186" end="0:03.596">なん</span><span begin="0:03.596" end="0:03.796">か</span><span begin="0:03.796" end="0:04.076">よ</span><span begin="0:04.076" end="0:04.226">り</span><span begin="0:04.226" end="0:04.406">も</span></p><p begin="0:04.656" end="0:07.816" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:04.656" end="0:04.896">ずっ</span><span begin="0:04.896" end="0:05.076">と</span><span begin="0:05.076" end="0:05.326">ずっ</span><span begin="0:05.326" end="0:05.456">と</span><span begin="0:05.456" end="0:05.746">大</span><span begin="0:05.746" end="0:06.206">切</span><span begin="0:06.206" end="0:06.326">に</span><span begin="0:06.326" end="0:06.666">す</span><span begin="0:06.666" end="0:06.806">る</span><span begin="0:06.806" end="0:07.046">も</span><span begin="0:07.046" end="0:07.206">の</span><span begin="0:07.206" end="0:07.536">が</span><span begin="0:07.536" end="0:07.676">あ</span><span begin="0:07.676" end="0:07.816">る</span></p><p begin="0:08.083" end="0:11.083" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.083" end="0:08.343">飾</span><span begin="0:08.343" end="0:08.483">ら</span><span begin="0:08.483" end="0:08.793">な</span><span begin="0:08.793" end="0:09.133">い真っ</span><span begin="0:09.133" end="0:09.363">直</span><span begin="0:09.363" end="0:09.593">ぐ</span><span begin="0:09.593" end="0:09.773">な</span><span begin="0:09.773" end="0:10.083">キ</span><span begin="0:10.083" end="0:10.233">ミ</span><span begin="0:10.233" end="0:10.483">の</span><span begin="0:10.483" end="0:11.083">想い</span></p><p begin="0:11.421" end="0:18.021" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:11.421" end="0:11.651">受け</span><span begin="0:11.651" end="0:11.811">取</span><span begin="0:11.811" end="0:11.961">れ</span><span begin="0:11.961" end="0:12.191">る</span><span begin="0:12.191" end="0:12.811">私</span><span begin="0:12.811" end="0:13.011">は</span> <span begin="0:13.011" end="0:13.171">と</span><span begin="0:13.171" end="0:13.471">て</span><span begin="0:13.471" end="0:13.591">も</span><span begin="0:13.591" end="0:14.331">幸</span><span begin="0:14.331" end="0:14.541">せ</span><span begin="0:14.541" end="0:14.931">者</span><span begin="0:14.931" end="0:15.281">だ</span><span begin="0:15.281" end="0:18.021">ね</span></p><p begin="0:28.882" end="0:35.442" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.882" end="0:29.312">友</span><span begin="0:29.312" end="0:29.922">達</span><span begin="0:29.922" end="0:30.112">の</span><span begin="0:30.132" end="0:31.062">友</span><span begin="0:31.062" end="0:32.082">達</span> <span begin="0:32.382" end="0:32.512">た</span><span begin="0:32.512" end="0:32.752">ま</span><span begin="0:32.752" end="0:32.992">た</span><span begin="0:33.012" end="0:33.432">ま</span><span begin="0:33.432" end="0:33.992">行っ</span><span begin="0:33.992" end="0:34.502">た</span><span begin="0:34.502" end="0:34.862">ラン</span><span begin="0:34.862" end="0:35.442">チ</span></p><p begin="0:35.825" end="0:42.325" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.825" end="0:36.205">相</span><span begin="0:36.205" end="0:36.695">槌</span><span begin="0:36.695" end="0:37.095">代</span><span begin="0:37.095" end="0:37.455">わ</span><span begin="0:37.455" end="0:37.825">り</span><span begin="0:37.825" end="0:38.315">コー</span><span begin="0:38.315" end="0:38.565">ヒー</span> <span begin="0:38.805" end="0:39.235">飲ん</span><span begin="0:39.235" end="0:39.385">で</span><span begin="0:39.385" end="0:39.585">ば</span><span begin="0:39.585" end="0:39.835">か</span><span begin="0:39.835" end="0:40.175">り</span> <span begin="0:40.515" end="0:40.625">無</span><span begin="0:40.625" end="0:41.115">口</span><span begin="0:41.115" end="0:41.305">な</span><span begin="0:41.305" end="0:41.515">キ</span><span begin="0:41.515" end="0:42.325">ミ</span></p><p begin="0:42.617" end="0:49.177" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.617" end="0:43.067">冗</span><span begin="0:43.067" end="0:43.567">談</span><span begin="0:43.567" end="0:44.267">通</span><span begin="0:44.267" end="0:44.767">じ</span><span begin="0:44.767" end="0:45.037">な</span><span begin="0:45.037" end="0:45.157">く</span><span begin="0:45.157" end="0:45.757">て</span> <span begin="0:46.037" end="0:46.237">そ</span><span begin="0:46.237" end="0:46.547">の</span><span begin="0:46.547" end="0:47.077">割</span><span begin="0:47.077" end="0:47.247">に</span><span begin="0:47.247" end="0:48.207">天</span><span begin="0:48.207" end="0:48.677">然</span><span begin="0:48.677" end="0:49.177">で</span></p><p begin="0:49.526" end="0:54.936" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:49.526" end="0:49.946">変</span><span begin="0:49.946" end="0:50.106">な</span><span begin="0:50.106" end="0:50.786">人</span><span begin="0:50.786" end="0: